{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And the people he transferred to cities.</b> So that they would no longer hold onto the land, because he had purchased their soil. Or perhaps after some time each man might return to his own land and say, 'This is my inheritance from my fathers'; therefore he transferred them, so that they would have no claim now, for each and every one dwelt in that of his fellow."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:54.283957384Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}